# Designer Style

- Tokens are the source of truth. No magic numbers in component styles.
- Use semantic token names and token-driven theming.
- Every meaningful component change requires Storybook story updates.
- All interactive elements need visible focus states and accessible names.
- Read the matching full convention file under `.claude/conventions/` before making non-trivial changes.
